{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CevKk1crYqSVp1bTkHRU8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! The verification command passed successfully.\n\n**Command:** `./mvnw test` (from sample-service directory)\n\n**Result:** \n- Tests run: 19 (previously 13, now +6 new tests)\n- Failures: 0\n- Errors: 0\n- Build: SUCCESS\n\n**Key tests added and passing:**\n1. OrderControllerTest - 5 new cancel tests:\n   - `cancel_active_order_succeeds_and_changes_status_to_CANCELLED`\n   - `cancel_active_order_cancels_its_created_shipments`\n   - `cancel_already_cancelled_order_succeeds_idempotently`\n   - `cancel_order_with_confirmed_shipment_returns_409_and_changes_nothing`\n   - `cancel_nonexistent_order_returns_404`\n\n2. ShipmentControllerTest - 1 new test:\n   - `create_shipment_for_cancelled_order_returns_409_with_ORDER_CANCELLED_error`\n\n3. All existing tests continue to pass with the new `status` field on Order entities\n\n<<PHASE:REVIEW>>\n\n**Acceptance criteria mapping:**\n\n1. ✅ **Existing build passes** - `./mvnw test` completed with BUILD SUCCESS\n2. ✅ **Existing tests pass** - All 13 existing tests still pass; no regressions\n3. ✅ **POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel endpoint** - Implemented in OrderController.kt, cancels active orders, persists cancelled status, cancels CREATED shipments\n4. ✅ **Error responses consistent** - Uses existing ApiException hierarchy with ConflictException (409) and ResourceNotFoundException (404), centralized GlobalExceptionHandler\n5. ✅ **Repeated cancel succeeds** - Test verifies idempotent behavior; cancel blocked by CONFIRMED shipment verified to change nothing; unknown order rejected with 404; shipment for cancelled order rejected with 409\n6. ✅ **No new Maven dependency** - Only modified .kt files, no pom.xml changes\n7. ✅ **No unrelated production file changes** - Only modified order and shipment packages plus api package for error codes\n\n**Diff review:**\n\n1. **Order.kt** - Added `status: OrderStatus` field and `OrderStatus` enum (ACTIVE, CANCELLED). Required because order now has lifecycle state.\n\n2. **OrderController.kt** - Added shipmentRepository dependency, updated create() to initialize orders with ACTIVE status, added cancel() endpoint with logic for checking confirmed shipments and transitioning state. Required for implementing cancel endpoint.\n\n3. **ShipmentRepository.kt** - Added `findByOrderId(orderId: String): List<Shipment>` method. Required to query shipments by order during cancel operation.\n\n4. **ShipmentController.kt** - Added orderRepository dependency, added order status check in create() endpoint. Required to prevent shipment creation on cancelled orders.\n\n5. **ApiError.kt** - Added `ORDER_HAS_CONFIRMED_SHIPMENT` and `ORDER_CANCELLED` error codes. Required for semantic error responses.\n\n6. **OrderControllerTest.kt** - Added 5 new test methods covering cancel endpoint scenarios, updated existing tests to verify ACTIVE status on creation. Required for test coverage.\n\n7. **ShipmentControllerTest.kt** - Added 1 new test method for cancelled order shipment creation, updated constructor to include orderRepository and reset method to clear both repositories. Required for test coverage.\n\n**Unresolved findings:** None. All requirements implemented and tested.\n\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n\n```\nRequirement   Add POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel endpoint that transitions orders to CANCELLED status, cancels CREATED shipments, handles idempotency, rejects confirmed-shipment blocks, and validates order existence with appropriate HTTP status codes.\n\nChanged       Order.kt: Added status field and OrderStatus enum (ACTIVE, CANCELLED)\n              OrderController.kt: Added shipmentRepository dependency, ACTIVE status initialization on create, POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel endpoint with validation and state transitions\n              ShipmentRepository.kt: Added findByOrderId method to query shipments by order\n              ShipmentController.kt: Added orderRepository dependency and cancelled order check in create endpoint\n              ApiError.kt: Added ORDER_HAS_CONFIRMED_SHIPMENT and ORDER_CANCELLED error codes\n              OrderControllerTest.kt: Added 5 new tests for cancel endpoint (success, created shipments cancellation, idempotency, confirmed shipment rejection, non-existent order)\n              ShipmentControllerTest.kt: Added 1 new test for shipment creation on cancelled order, updated cleanup to include order repository\n\nTests         cancel_active_order_succeeds_and_changes_status_to_CANCELLED: Verifies ACTIVE→CANCELLED transition and response\n              cancel_active_order_cancels_its_created_shipments: Verifies CREATED shipments become CANCELLED when order cancelled\n              cancel_already_cancelled_order_succeeds_idempotently: Verifies re-cancel succeeds without changes\n              cancel_order_with_confirmed_shipment_returns_409_and_changes_nothing: Verifies order/shipments unchanged on conflict\n              cancel_nonexistent_order_returns_404: Verifies ORDER_NOT_FOUND error code\n              create_shipment_for_cancelled_order_returns_409_with_ORDER_CANCELLED_error: Verifies 409 with ORDER_CANCELLED code\n\nVerification  Command: ./mvnw test\n              Result: Tests run: 19, Failures: 0, Errors: 0, Build SUCCESS (6 new tests added to existing 13)\n\nNot done      None - all acceptance criteria satisfied and verified\n```\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2483,"cache_read_input_tokens":38427,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2483},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8c4de118-bd94-4d61-a0c1-fcb